      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00125",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve never seen strength like this!\n",
        "Just running all day long!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00126",
      "en_US": [
        "Once I get moving, I can’t stop!\n",
        "I’m in a perpetual Pokéathlon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00127",
      "en_US": [
        "My engine is friendship, and my motor\n",
        "is victory!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00128",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s no chance! I’ll knock down all\n",
        "Pokémon competition!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00129",
      "en_US": [
        "Getting in the Ring is the end! Fight to\n",
        "be the last Pokémon standing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00130",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruler of the Ring!\n",
        "Enter another’s Ring at your own risk!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00131",
      "en_US": [
        "What exactly are you anyway?\n",
        "That’s what the Ring will tell you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00132",
      "en_US": [
        "Throwing Snow is the best in the world!\n",
        "With that kind of accuracy, you can win!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00133",
      "en_US": [
        "The Snowballs we’re throwing are\n",
        "rolled-up balls of friendship!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00134",
      "en_US": [
        "Such rapid-fire throwing! Who’s that\n",
        "Snowball for?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00135",
      "en_US": [
        "I don’t know where it will leap from\n",
        "next! The Snowballs seem to split!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00136",
      "en_US": [
        "No one can stop this ball! It will hit\n",
        "any Goal I aim for!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00137",
      "en_US": [
        "Use that wonderful teamwork and make\n",
        "the Goal!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00138",
      "en_US": [
        "Such splendid footwork!\n",
        "Aim for success!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00139",
      "en_US": [
        "Live with the ball.\n",
        "Live inside the ball!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00140",
      "en_US": [
        "Give the points as a gift to them. It’s\n",
        "the embodiment of fair play.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00141",
      "en_US": [
        "Smile even when you miss! The\n",
        "Pokéathlon isn’t just about winning!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00142",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t hesitate to aim for your\n",
        "own Goal!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00143",
      "en_US": [
        "Don’t fight over who rolled the ball\n",
        "into your Goal! It’s your friendship!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00144",
      "en_US": [
        "Why do you stand out like that? Winning\n",
        "is not the only thing in the Pokéathlon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00145",
      "en_US": [
        "Here it is! What you’ve all been waiting\n",
        "for! Autographs after the competition!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00146",
      "en_US": [
        "If you want to see me win, I’ll show you\n",
        "just how I win!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00147",
      "en_US": [
        "When I do my best and win, I make\n",
        "everyone happy!\r"
      ]
    },
