    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00197",
      "en_US": "{ALN_CENTER}Event Rules"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00198",
      "en_US": "Aim for the Goal and jump! Run!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00199",
      "en_US": "Run, collect Pennants, and return!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00200",
      "en_US": "Get in the Circle!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00201",
      "en_US": "Break lots of Blocks!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00202",
      "en_US": "Catch the flying Discs!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00203",
      "en_US": "Jump and aim for the lit Lamps!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00204",
      "en_US": "Run a Relay with Pokémon! Run!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00205",
      "en_US": "Push your rivals out of the Ring!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00206",
      "en_US": "Hit as many Pokémon as you can!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00207",
      "en_US": "Get the ball in an opponent’s Goal!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00208",
      "en_US": "{ALN_CENTER}Controls"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00209",
      "en_US": [
        "Touch the Pokémon to jump!\n",
        "Control three Pokémon at the\n",
        "same time. Jump the Hurdles!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00210",
      "en_US": [
        "In Hurdle Dash, you race against time to\n",
        "the finish line. Jump over the Hurdles\n",
        "and be first to finish. Points are given\n",
        "based on how many seconds it took all\n",
        "three Pokémon to reach the finish line.\n",
        "\n",
        "Speed: Running Speed\n",
        "Jump: Jump Length"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00211",
      "en_US": [
        "Touch the Pokémon to jump!\n",
        "Jump to clear the Hurdles!\n",
        "\n",
        "Control three Pokémon at the same\n",
        "time and finish before\n",
        "everyone else!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00212",
      "en_US": [
        "Slide the stylus over a\n",
        "Pokémon to move it! Hit others\n",
        "from behind to take Pennants!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00213",
      "en_US": [
        "In Pennant Capture, your three Pokémon\n",
        "run in turns to bring back Pennants.\n",
        "Up to nine Pennants can be held at\n",
        "one time. Strike your opponents from\n",
        "behind to steal their Pennants.\n",
        "\n",
        "Skill: Ease of Movement\n",
        "Speed: Running Speed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00214",
      "en_US": [
        "Slide your stylus over your Pokémon\n",
        "quickly to move it!\n",
        "The farther you slide, the more it moves!\n",
        "\n",
        "Be quicker than anyone else to\n",
        "gather as many Pennants as you\n",
        "can and bring them back!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00215",
      "en_US": [
        "Use the stylus to move your\n",
        "Pokémon around! Control\n",
        "three Pokémon at once!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00216",
      "en_US": [
        "Circle Push is an event where you push\n",
        "your opponent. If you are inside a Circle\n",
        "after the timer has counted down,\n",
        "you are awarded points. The number\n",
        "written in the Circle is the number of\n",
        "points you will receive.\n",
        "\n",
        "Power: Push Power\n",
        "Stamina: Ability to Keep Pushing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00217",
      "en_US": [
        "Use the stylus to move your\n",
        "Pokémon around!\n",
        "\n",
        "Control three Pokémon at once and\n",
        "aim for the Circle with the\n",
        "most points!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00218",
      "en_US": [
        "Touch the Blocks to strike!\n",
        "Touch the Switch button to\n",
        "switch to the next Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00219",
      "en_US": [
        "Block Smash is simply an event where you\n",
        "smash Blocks. Switch out your Pokémon\n",
        "as each becomes tired. You receive\n",
        "points according to how many Blocks\n",
        "you smash.\n",
        "\n",
        "Power: Destructive Power\n",
        "Stamina: Ability to Keep Going"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00220",
      "en_US": [
        "Touch the Blocks to smash them!\n",
        "There’s a barrage of Blocks. Smash as\n",
        "many as you can!\n",
        "\n",
        "Touch the Switch button to switch\n",
        "to the next Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00221",
      "en_US": [
        "1) Use the stylus to move\n",
        "three Pokémon around.\n",
        "2) Touch to jump and catch!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00222",
      "en_US": [
        "Disc Catch is an event where you control\n",
        "your three Pokémon at the same time and\n",
        "jump to catch Discs that come flying\n",
        "from the sea. The farther back in the\n",
        "stage that you catch the Discs, the\n",
        "more points you get.\n",
        "\n",
        "Jump: Jump Height\n",
        "Power: Push Power"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00223",
      "en_US": [
        "1) Use the stylus to move your Pokémon\n",
        "around. Control three Pokémon at once.\n",
        "Push your opponents out of the way to\n",
        "catch the Discs!\n",
        "\n",
        "2) Touch your Pokémon lightly to\n",
        "jump! Catch as many Discs\n",
        "as you can!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00224",
      "en_US": [
        "Quickly pull the Pokémon\n",
        "down to jump!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00225",
      "en_US": [
        "In Lamp Jump, you control your three\n",
        "Pokémon as they try to jump and touch\n",
        "the Lamps as they light. Try to touch as\n",
        "many Lamps as you can in one jump.\n",
        "\n",
        "Jump: Jump Height\n",
        "Skill: Ability to Jump Sideways"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00226",
      "en_US": [
        "Quickly pull the three Pokémon down and\n",
        "watch them jump!\n",
        "\n",
        "Pull them diagonally to have them\n",
        "jump to the side!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00227",
      "en_US": [
        "Quickly flick to dash! Flick as\n",
        "fast as you can to go faster!\n",
        "Switch when you’re tired!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00228",
      "en_US": [
        "Relay Run is an event where you move from\n",
        "Pokémon to Pokémon, trying to run\n",
        "as far as you can. Switch your Pokémon\n",
        "when they’re tired. Points will be\n",
        "awarded based only on the distance run.\n",
        "\n",
        "Stamina: Endurance\n",
        "Speed: Running Speed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00229",
      "en_US": [
        "Quickly flick the stylus to the right to\n",
        "get your Pokémon to dash!\n",
        "\n",
        "The more you flick to the right, the\n",
        "faster your Pokémon will go!\n",
        "\n",
        "Touch the Switch button to\n",
        "switch to the next Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00230",
      "en_US": [
        "1) Use the stylus to move.\n",
        "2) Quickly flick to tackle!\n",
        "3) Lightly touch to jump!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00231",
      "en_US": [
        "Ring Drop is an event where you push\n",
        "your opponent. You get points each time\n",
        "you push your opponent out of the Ring.\n",
        "If you push the Switch button in your\n",
        "corner, you can switch Pokémon.\n",
        "\n",
        "Stamina: Ability to Resist Pushing\n",
        "Power: Tackle Strength"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00232",
      "en_US": [
        "1) Use the stylus to move your Pokémon!\n",
        "\n",
        "2) Quickly flick the stylus to tackle!\n",
        "Blow your opponent away!\n",
        "\n",
        "3) Lightly touch your\n",
        "Pokémon to get them to jump!\n",
        "Your Pokémon can stomp on others!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00233",
      "en_US": [
        "1) Quickly flick upward on\n",
        "your Pokémon to throw Snow!\n",
        "2) Touch to hoard more Snow!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00234",
      "en_US": [
        "In Snow Throw, you control three of your\n",
        "Pokémon at the same time and hit your\n",
        "opponents with Snowballs. You’ll receive\n",
        "points no matter who you hit on your\n",
        "opponent’s team.\n",
        "\n",
        "Skill: Throwing Accuracy\n",
        "Power: Snowball Strength"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00235",
      "en_US": [
        "1) Flick upward on your Pokémon to\n",
        "throw a Snowball!\n",
        "\n",
        "2) When holding a Snowball, touch the\n",
        "Pokémon to make the Snowball bigger!\n",
        "\n",
        "Bigger Snowballs can make your\n",
        "opponent faint on impact!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00236",
      "en_US": [
        "1) Control three Pokémon! Use\n",
        "the stylus to move around!\n",
        "2) Flick quickly to dash!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00237",
      "en_US": [
        "In Goal Roll, you try to get the ball into\n",
        "your opponent’s Goal. It doesn’t matter\n",
        "which of their Goals--you’ll earn points.\n",
        "But if the ball ends up in your own Goal,\n",
        "you’ll lose points.\n",
        "\n",
        "Skill: Rolling Length\n",
        "Power: Rolling Strength"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0309_00238",
      "en_US": [
        "1) Control three Pokémon at once. Use\n",
        "the stylus to move your Pokémon!\n",
        "\n",
        "2) Flick quickly with the stylus to\n",
        "dash! If you’re dashing, then\n",
        "you can shoot for the Goal!"
      ]
    },
